{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122236","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122236/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122236/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122236/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122236","id":5103342770,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc78q10a","number":122236,"title":"Fix reflection probe ambient light blend factor in Compatibility renderer","user":{"login":"BoraYalcinn","id":195580819,"node_id":"U_kgDOC6hTkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/195580819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn","html_url":"https://github.com/BoraYalcinn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BoraYalcinn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-08-09T15:41:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T15:13:30Z","closed_at":"2026-09-26T15:13:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122236","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122236","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122236.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122236.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-26T15:13:20Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n- Closes #118698\r\n\r\nReflectionProbe ambient light was blending incorrectly with sky lighting\r\nin the Compatibility (GLES3) renderer, producing a black tint near the\r\nedges of a probe's blend region instead of correctly fading to the sky.\r\nThis did not happen in Forward+ or Mobile.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nIn `drivers/gles3/shaders/scene.glsl`, the final ambient light mix was\r\nusing `scene_data_block.data.ambient_color_sky_mix` (the environment's\r\nunrelated \"Ambient Sky Contribution\" setting) as the blend factor between\r\nthe probe's ambient contribution and the base ambient light, instead of\r\nusing the probe's own coverage value (`ambient_accum.a`), which reflects\r\nhow much of the probe's blend distance is actually applied at a given\r\npoint. Since `ambient_color_sky_mix` doesn't change as a point moves\r\nthrough the probe's blend region, the base ambient light never had a\r\nchance to show through near the edges, causing the black tint.\r\n\r\nFixed by using `ambient_accum.a` as the mix factor, matching how the\r\nsame computation works in the Forward+/Mobile (RD) shaders\r\n(`scene_forward_lights_inc.glsl`), where the ambient contribution is\r\naccumulated based on coverage and the remainder naturally falls back to\r\nthe base ambient light.\r\n\r\nTested with the MRP from the issue:\r\n- Compatibility renderer: ReflectionProbe ambient now correctly fades to\r\n  sky lighting near blend edges, for both Environment and custom-color\r\n  ambient modes\r\n- Forward+ / Mobile: unaffected, no regression\r\n\r\n### AI disclosure\r\nI used Claude (Anthropic) as a debugging assistant throughout this process.\r\nI searched the codebase and ran the comparisons myself, and Claude helped\r\nme navigate through the codebase then I've identified the root cause by comparing\r\n the Compatibility renderer's ambient blend logic against the equivalent Forward+/Mobile\r\n shader code, and  fixed it.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122236/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122236/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}